# Components / pages

- Prefer existing section inventory in `docs/PLATFORM.md` before creating new components.
- Pages compose sections; visibility from `pages.ts` + config — no hardcoded client names, pricing, or URLs in components.
- Customization ladder (`docs/AGENT.md`): config → compose → generic platform section → `src/components/site/*` one-offs. Do not fork shared sections per client.
- Promote to platform only when a second site needs the same pattern without client branding.
- Semantic theme classes only (`text-fg*`, `surface-card`, `btn-accent`). Never `text-neutral-*` / `bg-white`.
- Photos: `ConfigImage` / `OptimizedImage` / `BrandLogo` — optimize desktop **and** mobile from the start (default srcset). Raw `<img>` only for SVG, icons, favicon, and 1×1 tracking pixels. Never drop jpg/png/webp photos into `public/`. Shopify catalog photos: `ShopifyImage` (CDN `width`).
